error[X0808]: `Both` can't have a destructor and implement `IDisposable`
  --> destructors.xn:43:20
   |
42 | class Both implements IDisposable {
   |                       ----------- `IDisposable` makes it manual
43 |   public function ~Both() {}
   |                    ^^^^ a destructor makes the class scoped
   |
   = note: a scoped class is destroyed when its scope ends; a manual one when `dispose()` is called (by `using` or by hand). A class is one or the other
help: move the destructor's code into `dispose()` and remove the destructor, or remove `implements IDisposable`

error[X0808]: `ResChild` can't have a destructor and implement `IDisposable`
  --> destructors.xn:48:20
   |
20 | class Res implements IDisposable {
   |       --- `IDisposable` comes from `Res`
...
48 |   public function ~ResChild() {}
   |                    ^^^^^^^^ a destructor makes the class scoped
   |
   = note: a scoped class is destroyed when its scope ends; a manual one when `dispose()` is called (by `using` or by hand). A class is one or the other
help: move the destructor's code into an override of `dispose()`

